{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kiss-riri-and-rogue-by-rihanna-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2602-0267","content_id":"fb7d77a7-2448-4599-8065-4a7d33c1ec77","description":"Product Recall for Rihanna Fragrances presenting a serious chemical risk.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"30d2fe41-d938-4c5b-be55-262f9772e1de","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-05T19:08:23+00:00","id":"30d2fe41-d938-4c5b-be55-262f9772e1de","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-05T19:08:23+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a9d4a75a86fe94496e783b/2602-0267-product-recall-savers-health-and-beauty-rihanna-perfumes.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Kiss, RiRi and Rogue By Rihanna Fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The products present a serious chemical risk as they contain butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA/lilial) and/or hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde. Both chemicals are prohibited in cosmetic products.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Savers Health and Beauty.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Fragrances</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Rihanna</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Kiss, RiRi and Rogue</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Three fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty stores. Affected products have the chemical ‘butylphenyl methylpropional’ and/or ‘hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde’ included on the ingredients label on the packaging of the product.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_30d2fe41-d938-4c5b-be55-262f9772e1de\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a9d4a75a86fe94496e783b/2602-0267-product-recall-savers-health-and-beauty-rihanna-perfumes.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-identifiers\">Additional Identifiers</h3>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Product Description</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Affected Product Barcodes</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rihanna Kiss 15ml edp</td>\n      <td>0608940572252</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rihanna Riri 15ml edp</td>\n      <td>0608940560389</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Rihanna Rogue 15ml edp</td>\n      <td>0608940559437</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The products present a serious chemical risk as they contain butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA/lilial) and/or hydroxyisohexyl 3-cyclohexene carboxaldehyde. Both chemicals are prohibited in cosmetic products. BMHCA may harm the reproductive system, may harm the health of the unborn child, and may cause skin sensitisation.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>Affected products have been recalled by Savers Health and Beauty.\nCustomers should return any of the above products purchased at a Savers store to the place of purchase, where they will be issued a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>Only products purchased in Savers Health and Beauty stores with the barcodes listed are affected by this recall. If you are unsure if you have one of the above products, please contact Savers Health and Beauty on <a href=\"mailto:help@savers.co.uk\">help@savers.co.uk</a> or access <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.savers.co.uk/prodrecall\">Product Recalls - Savers.</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2602-0267</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-05T19:09:38Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-identifiers","level":3,"text":"Additional Identifiers"}],"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-05","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-05T19:09:39+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kiss-riri-and-rogue-by-rihanna-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2602-0267","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kiss-riri-and-rogue-by-rihanna-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2602-0267","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-kiss-riri-and-rogue-by-rihanna-fragrances-sold-by-savers-health-and-beauty-2602-0267","content_id":"fb7d77a7-2448-4599-8065-4a7d33c1ec77","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-05T19:09:39Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Kiss, RiRi and Rogue By Rihanna Fragrances sold by Savers Health and Beauty (2602-0267)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/